This version incorporates the selection of the CRTC associated with eDP-1, session management with libseat, and a display test using drmModeSetCrtc(). Device access and session notifications follow the libseat interface.

The program will attempt to display the same rectangles we drew with Pixman for three seconds and then restore the previous mode.
#In tty
cargo --release build &
./drm-05 --show /dev/dri/card1
